{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= if v_2 > 0 ∧ v_3 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_1)) ∧ v_3 < ndim(v_1) then v_2 = shape(v_1, v_3)
>>
Rule 26 (num must be int and positive if specified, or None(inferred))
{v_1 : int ⊎ str} |= (v_1 > 0) ∨ (v_1 = "none")
>>
Rule 27 (The shape of value along the axis must be positive)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_1)) ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1) then shape(v_1, v_2) > 0
>>
Rule 29 (If num is specified, it should match the shape of value at the axis if axis is valid and num is a positive number.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= if v_3 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_1)) ∧ v_3 < ndim(v_1) ∧ v_2 > 0 then v_2 = shape(v_1, v_3)
>>
Rule 32 (If axis is specified then shape of value along the axis must be equal to num, if num is available)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int, v_3 : int} |= if v_3 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_1)) ∧ v_3 < ndim(v_1) ∧ v_2 ≠ "none" then shape(v_1, v_3) = v_2
