Rule 41 (the sum of axis and rank of tensor should be a valid dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if (0 - ndim(v_1)) ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1) then (ndim(v_1) + v_2) ≥ 0
