Rule 46 (The shape of each result tensor is equal to the shape of the input tensor, with the target axis removed.)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= if v_2 ≥ (0 - ndim(v_1)) ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1) then ndim(v_1) - 1 > 0
